WIP kernel for the T-Mobile Revvl 6 Pro/T-Phone Pro 2023

(may not reflect current commit and your device)

What works:
Battery gauge
GPU
CPU
Most of the sensors
Side buttons
Hardware decoding
Hardware encoding
Display (BOE panel not tested.)

What partially works:
Audio (Headphone jack, microphone and earpiece speaker works; Main speaker doesn't work.)
Touchscreen (Touch is all wonky)
Modem (Mobile data, calls and SMS aren't tested.)
USB (OTG doesn't work)

What doesn't:
SD Cards
Side fingerprint scanner
Camera
Connectivity (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth)

